Package: typesafer
Title: Unofficial Client for the TypeSafe System One API
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Sam", "Parmar", , "parmartsam@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An unofficial client for the TypeSafe System One API
    <https://docs.typesafe.ai/api>. Ask typed yes/no (noul), choice, and
    score questions about text or structured state and get calibrated
    probabilities back as typed R objects or tidy data frames.
